# Translation Learning Output

## 1. Original Text

解凍資金

## 2. Natural Translation

Unfreeze the funds

## 3. Simple Translation

Make the frozen money usable again

## 4. Key Vocabulary

| Word / Phrase | Meaning | Example Sentence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **unfreeze** | 解凍；解除凍結狀態，使資金恢復可用 | The bank agreed to **unfreeze** the account after the investigation was completed. |
| **frozen funds** | 被凍結的資金；無法動用的款項 | The company cannot access its **frozen funds** until the legal dispute is resolved. |
| **release** | 釋放；解除限制讓資金可動用 | The court ordered the bank to **release** the funds to the rightful owner. |
| **lift the freeze** | 解除凍結；取消資金鎖定措施 | The government **lifted the freeze** on humanitarian aid within 48 hours. |

## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern

**Pattern:** `unfreeze + (the) + funds / assets / accounts`（動詞 + 受詞，表示「解除⋯⋯的凍結」）

**Example:** The manager will unfreeze the funds once all documents are verified.

## 6. Speaking Version

"Release the money that was put on hold."

## 7. Common Mistake

❌ **錯誤用法：** "defrost the funds"
> "Defrost" 指的是「解凍食物」，用在資金上不自然且容易引起誤解。

✅ **正確用法：** "unfreeze the funds"
> 在金融語境中，解除資金凍結應使用 **unfreeze** 或 **release**，而非 defrost。

## 8. One Sentence to Remember

> **"The bank will unfreeze your funds within three business days."**
> （銀行會在三個工作天內解凍你的資金。）

